    <!-- NB: dashboard_rights must NOT declare menus in the ks_dashboard_ninja.*
         xmlid namespace. A previous block here re-declared
         ks_dashboard_ninja.dashboards_menu_root with parent
         ks_dashboard_ninja.board_menu_root — both are already owned/created by
         ks_dashboard_ninja itself (see ks_dashboard_ninja_view.xml). On any DB
         where board_menu_root's external ID isn't resolvable at load time
         (e.g. a differently-versioned KS build, or one where the menu was
         removed), that cross-module parent reference raised
         "External ID not found: ks_dashboard_ninja.board_menu_root" and aborted
         the whole install. It was also redundant. Removed. -->

